--------------------
Received only from legitimate DHCP Server

Summary
=======

Problem:
Unauthorized devices could act as DHCP Servers and distribute incorrect network information.

Solution:
Use DHCP Snooping to detect and block DHCP replies from untrusted ports.

Benefit:
Protects users from rogue DHCP servers and improves network visibility.

Limitation:
Does not prevent DHCP Starvation attacks.

